{"3941080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Jingle Strike VR Bowling", "steam_appid": 3941080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THIS IS BOWLING WITH AN OPNIONATED ELF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/452a83f8168b42a8b576452c3e017120.poster.avif?t=1778553059\" width=608 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/452a83f8168b42a8b576452c3e017120.webm?t=1778553059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/452a83f8168b42a8b576452c3e017120.mp4?t=1778553059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Judging every throw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Jingle Strike VR Bowling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line up your shot. Release the ball…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…and try not to get roasted.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GAME THAT CHANGES WITH THE SEASONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/c0afe8fc038f77f85b5564c2166f81bf.poster.avif?t=1778553059\" width=608 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/c0afe8fc038f77f85b5564c2166f81bf.webm?t=1778553059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/c0afe8fc038f77f85b5564c2166f81bf.mp4?t=1778553059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jingle Strike isn’t fixed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lanes, atmosphere, and energy evolve throughout the year - bringing new looks, moods, and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right now, it’s <strong>Spring</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect bright colours, playful details, and a lighter, more chaotic energy across the lanes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future updates will continue to transform the game as the seasons roll on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HEAD-TO-HEAD: VS ELF MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/009551ac0f360feb2dd5dc2b48a24640.poster.avif?t=1778553059\" width=608 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/009551ac0f360feb2dd5dc2b48a24640.webm?t=1778553059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/009551ac0f360feb2dd5dc2b48a24640.mp4?t=1778553059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not just bowling well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re trying to beat someone who wants to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The elf takes their turn.<br>You take yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And suddenly every frame matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE NOT ALONE ON THE LANE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/113b4a71714ead7125a58bf39838695e.poster.avif?t=1778553059\" width=608 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/113b4a71714ead7125a58bf39838695e.webm?t=1778553059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/113b4a71714ead7125a58bf39838695e.mp4?t=1778553059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every game is shared with an elf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They react to everything you do:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >strikes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >misses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >gutter balls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes they cheer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes they don’t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes they enjoy it a little too much.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROVE YOU’VE MASTERED THE LANE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/b7c50d183c2adda1ef64e7f00c74a9af.poster.avif?t=1778553059\" width=608 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/b7c50d183c2adda1ef64e7f00c74a9af.webm?t=1778553059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/b7c50d183c2adda1ef64e7f00c74a9af.mp4?t=1778553059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beating an elf isn’t enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To truly master Jingle Strike, you’ll need to outperform them - consistently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn up to three stars in each matchup by delivering stronger, cleaner games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outplay every elf<br>and prove you’ve really got it?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REAL VR THROWING THAT ACTUALLY FEELS RIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just pick up the ball and throw - or use the fast bowling system if you want to keep things moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The physics are tuned to feel natural, responsive, and satisfying - whether you’re going for precision or power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAST MODE: 85 SECOND SLAM-DOWN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/27e7ce3bcf83469066f3062262555b15.poster.avif?t=1778553059\" width=608 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/27e7ce3bcf83469066f3062262555b15.webm?t=1778553059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/27e7ce3bcf83469066f3062262555b15.mp4?t=1778553059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pressure. Just speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve got 85 seconds to knock down as many pins as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab. Throw. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOCAL PARTY MODE (1–5 PLAYERS)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/e4ed3266b5ddaa3315e71a905b6b53f2.poster.avif?t=1778553059\" width=608 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/e4ed3266b5ddaa3315e71a905b6b53f2.webm?t=1778553059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/e4ed3266b5ddaa3315e71a905b6b53f2.mp4?t=1778553059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass the headset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take turns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to mess up in front of everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHY PEOPLE KEEP PLAYING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/e4b6731839602c2454c8c0091f30a970.poster.avif?t=1778553059\" width=608 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/e4b6731839602c2454c8c0091f30a970.webm?t=1778553059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/e4b6731839602c2454c8c0091f30a970.mp4?t=1778553059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s not just about getting a strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s about:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >handling the pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >beating the elf</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >adapting as the game evolves</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And going again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because you know you can do better.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURE LIST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/833a3e9629f1ec1ddd690c8dd3469ef1.poster.avif?t=1778553059\" width=608 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/833a3e9629f1ec1ddd690c8dd3469ef1.webm?t=1778553059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/833a3e9629f1ec1ddd690c8dd3469ef1.mp4?t=1778553059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physical VR bowling with natural throw mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reactive elf opponents with personality and voice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head-to-head VS mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced arcade mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer (pass-and-play)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasona